{
  "name": "Price drop tracker with email alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "83bc4605-5db9-5bb4-84bf-a6850debebfc",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"urls\": [\n      \"https://example.com/product\"\n    ],\n    \"price_regex\": \"\\\\$\\\\s?([0-9][0-9,]*\\\\.?[0-9]*)\",\n    \"target_price\": 100\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5a985ce7-e875-56d4-8554-214c45e88353",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $('Settings').first().json.config.urls.map((url) => ({ json: { url } }));"
      },
      "id": "49783890-f3d3-5d7e-bb7b-95a7ef570981",
      "name": "List what to check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "457b6b5d-953c-58e0-be28-bde111cd3526",
      "name": "Fetch the page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const $json = item.json;\n  const url = $('List what to check').all()[i].json.url;\n  const body = String($json.body || $json.data || '');\n  const m = body.match(new RegExp(cfg.price_regex));\n  const price = m ? parseFloat(String(m[1]).replace(/,/g, '')) : null;\n  const problem = price !== null && price <= Number(cfg.target_price);\n  const detail = price === null ? 'Could not read the price' : 'Price is ' + price + ' (target ' + cfg.target_price + ')';\n  return { json: { url, problem, detail, checked_at: new Date().toISOString() } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "bf170827-9a69-5bc6-b331-c445c4c1300f",
      "name": "Judge the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "083f019d-6c57-5167-bf08-d24aff5b07a7",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.problem }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "562fa116-90cc-52e1-86fa-19a4cdc35426",
      "name": "Problem found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.owner_email }}",
        "subject": "=Price alert: {{ $json.url }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.detail }}\n{{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "a1a717ed-473c-58c8-be34-71cd1d8aa811",
      "name": "Email me the alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Price drop tracker with email alert\nReads a price from a product page every few hours and emails you when it drops to your target. Works on pages that show the price in plain HTML.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e5e963f9-f022-5b65-a9d3-437d02e5d0fe",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Open **Settings** and list the addresses to check (and your email). Set **target_price** and, if the page uses a different format, the **price_regex** (first capture group = the number).\n2. Connect Gmail on **Email me the alert**.\n3. Run it once by hand, look at **Judge the result** to see what it found, then switch to **Active**.\n4. It only emails you when something is wrong, so a quiet inbox means all is well.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d33e8c4f-6233-54dc-a87f-059251393248",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List what to check",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List what to check": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch the page",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch the page": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Judge the result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Judge the result": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Problem found?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Problem found?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email me the alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
